{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a circle. Everything else wants you gone.<br>But every time you die, you leave something behind \u2014 a glowing shield, a permanent upgrade, a memory of failure turned into a tool for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Die. Upgrade. Try again.</strong><br>In this neon-lit bullet hell, every death creates a persistent upgrade that stays on the battlefield \u2014 blocking bullets, shaping new strategies, and gradually turning chaos into rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a small, free game I made during a game jam.<br>I liked the vibe, so I decided to polish it up and share it here on Steam. It\u2019s short, weird, and (hopefully) satisfying. No microtransactions, no fluff \u2014 just you, the shapes, and the bullets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760890?t=1749131199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760890?t=1749131199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760890/e72bc6421598c2c50c09283d1910d5258aa5b96b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749131199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760890/e72bc6421598c2c50c09283d1910d5258aa5b96b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749131199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re a circle. Everything else wants you gone.<br>But every time you die, you leave something behind \u2014 a glowing shield, a permanent upgrade, a memory of failure turned into a tool for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Die. Upgrade. Try again.</strong><br>In this neon-lit bullet hell, every death creates a persistent upgrade that stays on the battlefield \u2014 blocking bullets, shaping new strategies, and gradually turning chaos into rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a small, free game I made during a game jam.<br>I liked the vibe, so I decided to polish it up and share it here on Steam. It\u2019s short, weird, and (hopefully) satisfying. No microtransactions, no fluff \u2014 just you, the shapes, and the bullets.</p>","developers":["Artemii Frolov"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760890/1d0aa9b912aafa7e5d4462f74cff1c9af7c8b245/header.jpg?t=1749131199","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Intel 64-bit or Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145329,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145329/movie480.mp4?t=1748384688","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145329/movie_max.mp4?t=1748384688"},"name":"DieRespawnRepeatTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145329/bc68d7253ed21998e488a154781039295024b251/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748384688","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145329/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748384688","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145329/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748384688"}}],"name":"Die. Respawn. Repeat.","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><